      "mergeID": "5c590732ce840977f44bec2f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "A lot of times when you play a long animation and something happens, you just want to stop the minute long animation and go check it out, or if you play it by accident and you have to wait the whole minute for it to stop, and also sometimes when you're doing an animation and by accident you change avatars, it will glitch out and prevent you from moving until the animation time goes off.\nso it would be a great idea to add a \"stop animation\" button, so you can instantly stop any animations you may be playing that you want to stop",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Button to \"Stop\" animations",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "59e7986148b4da48e00baf9d",
